Cumulative displacement products derived from Sentinel-1 time series processed by Pedro Espin Bedon, University of Leeds.

Each filename includes the LiCSAR frame identifier and the corresponding start and end dates of the observation period. Displacement values are expressed in millimetres (mm).

The original interferograms were generated at a spatial resolution of 30 m. The final time-series products distributed in this repository are provided at a spatial resolution of 60 m.

Files located in the repository root directory are the original cumulative displacement products and retain the original LiCSBAS reference area used during time-series processing.

Additional products are organised into two folders:

• All_period/
  Contains cumulative displacement maps covering the complete observation period. Both the original and ERA5-corrected cumulative displacement products are provided. These products have been re-referenced using the following reference area:
  Longitude: 40.93682–40.94682
  Latitude: 12.63819–12.64819

• Pre/
  Contains cumulative displacement maps covering only the period prior to the intrusion. Both the original and ERA5-corrected cumulative displacement products are provided. These products have been re-referenced using the same reference area:
  Longitude: 40.93682–40.94682
  Latitude: 12.63819–12.64819

All files are distributed in GeoTIFF format with displacement values expressed in millimetres (mm).
